Package: newscid
Version: 1.0.0-1
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Christopher Patrick Fair <christopherpatrickfair@gmail.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgtk-3-0 (>= 3.24.0), libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 | libwebkit2gtk-4.0-37
Recommends: stockfish | fruit
Homepage: https://github.com/christopherpatrickfair/newscid
Description: Modern Chess Information Database (Scid vs. PC Rewrite)
 NewScid is a fresh, database-compatible rewrite of Scid vs. PC featuring a modern,
 intuitive user interface built with Wails v2 (Go backend) and Vue 3 (TypeScript + Vite).
 .
 Features full native compatibility with Scid .si4/.sn4/.sg4 databases, PGN import/export,
 real-time UCI chess engine analysis, opening tree explorer, and tactics training.
